if {gardener_introduced} == false:
	set {gardener_introduced} = true
	join detective right
	detective: Hello.
	detective: I'm here to ask you about the murder.
	detective: Tell me everything you know about what happened tonight.
	join gardener left
	gardener: Well, someone took the Count down.
	gardener: ...that's all I know.
	detective: ...
	gardener: ...
	detective: ...
	gardener: I was, y'know, gardening. 
	gardener: I generally don't step foot in the house when there're houseguests over.
	gardener (antsy): Not that Drac lets me come in usually anyway.
	gardener (speaking): That door you just took to get out here is almost always locked.
	gardener: Tonight was no different.
	gardener: ...

	detective: Tell me about yourself.
	gardener: I-I'm really just a gardener.
	gardener: I uproot weeds, water plants, y'know...
	gardener: 'fraid I'm not really sure what's going on so I'm real sorry I'm not much help.
	gardener: I’m more suited to shoveling dirt.
else:
	join gardener left
	gardener: Sup?
- Question
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"present_evidence":"gardener"}"]
- Leave
